flowchart TB
    subgraph Client["AllternitHarness client"]
        A[Caller code] --> B([stream / complete / run])
    end

    B --> C{Validate request}
    C -->|messages, provider, model| D[Apply middleware<br/>beforeRequest]

    D --> E[Inject Allternit system prompt]
    E --> F[Inject provider prompt]
    F --> G[Model registry fallback<br/>maxOutputTokens]

    G --> H{Config mode}
    H -->|byok| I[BYOK provider route]
    H -->|cloud| J[Allternit Cloud]
    H -->|local| K[Local model server]
    H -->|subprocess| L[Custom subprocess]

    I --> M[Provider API<br/>SSE stream]
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M

    M --> N[Normalize chunks]
    N --> O{text / tool_call /<br/>citation / done}

    O -->|success| P[Apply middleware<br/>afterResponse]
    O -->|retryable error| Q[Retry middleware<br/>exponential backoff]
    O -->|refusal| R[Refusal fallback<br/>next model]

    Q --> M
    R --> M

    P --> S[Return response]
    S --> T[(llm_usage_events)]

    style Client fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style T fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
